  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU for Prespa - Restoration of natural resources and enhancing sustainable agriculture and tourism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the overall Action &#x201c;EU for Prespa&#x201d; is to promote the Green Agenda for the Western Balkans in the transboundary Prespa Lake area in line with the &#x201c;no persons and regions left behind&#x201d;. The Specific Objective of the Project &#x201c;Restoration of natural resources and enhancing sustainable agriculture and tourism&#x201d; is to instigate a significant change in practices and behaviour among policy makers at local level, farmers, private sector, CSO and citizens regarding the management of and the sustainable use of natural resources in the Prespa region which will result in improved quality of life and contribute to economic development by emerging &#x201c;green&#x201d; pathways to growth.</narrative>
  </description>
